year, André Rieu celebrates a spectacular milestone — the 20th anniversary of his iconic summer concerts on the magnificent Vrijthof square. Captured live in his beloved hometown, this brand-new cinema event marks two decades of music and unforgettable magical summer nights. Viva Maastricht! is a joyful tribute to the city where it all began. Joined by his world-renowned Johann Strauss Orchestra and a vibrant ensemble of artists, André brings the spirit, culture, and warmth of his hometown to life in a dazzling new concert filled with emotion and wonder. From timeless waltzes to soul-stirring classics, this landmark anniversary concert promises an evening of passion, joy, and togetherness. Be part of this historic celebration as the Vrijthof once again transforms into a breathtaking open-air ballroom — only in cinemas this summer.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"This year, André Rieu celebrates a spectacular milestone — the 20th anniversary of his iconic summer concerts on the magnificent Vrijthof square.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"0000000010\",\"censorRatingNote\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2026-08-07\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":165,\"trailerUrl\":null,\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000335\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\",\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"HO00000336\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000055\"],\"externalIds\":{\"moviexchangeReleaseId\":\"a73b32c9-cde1-4f0c-9969-473043393c2b\",\"corporateId\":null},\"hopk\":\"HO00008932\",\"hoCode\":\"A000010077\",\"eventId\":\"0000000001\",\"distributorName\":\"PIECE OF MAGIC\"}],\"castAndCrew\":[{\"id\":\"0000002221\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Cal\",\"familyName\":\"Brunker\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000002222\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Jennifer\",\"familyName\":\"Dodge\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000003857\",\"name\":{\"givenName\":\"Snoop\",\"familyName\":\"Dogg\",\"middleName\":null}},{\"id\":\"0000004749\",\"name\":{\